    PositiveAt (α:=α) M H hH Wslot bslot (a/max 1 b) b 2 0 L Lslot lo hi
      Mcap εchild κ Z η₀ Q degree S C₁ →
    ∀(w σ freq:α→ℝ)(height mesh:ℝ),0≤ mesh → (∀i,0≤ w i) → (∀i,w i≤ mesh) →
